 continuation, and every substitution shape) and the journal-observable\\n> Section 13.12 failure rows. Two seams carry real `SIGKILL` evidence; nine\\n> narrowing mutants (one token-preserving) prove the classification predicates\\n> and every rejection rule. The conformance matrix in\\n> [`internal/crashgate/TRACEABILITY.md`](internal/crashgate/TRACEABILITY.md)\\n> maps every clause and boundary ID to its test row, owner, or stated bound.\\n> It adds no `ax` command, no `doctor` result, and no runtime capability claim.\\n> \\n> ```bash\\n> go test ./internal/crashgate -count=1\\n> go test ./internal/crashgate -count=1 -cover\\n> python3 internal/crashgate/mutant_harness.py --log-dir .temp/TASK-260830-17ootk/mutants\\n> CRASHGATE_CONFORMANCE_DIR=.temp/TASK-260830-17ootk/conformance go test ./internal/crashgate -count=1\\n2652c2681\\n< contract rows, 36 pinned or catalog-referenced normative section keys, 105\\n---\\n> contract rows, 36 pinned or catalog-referenced normative section keys, 107\\n2754c2783\\n< section coverage: bindings=56 full=1 partial=3 sliver=1 unevidenced=48 unmeasured=3 unowned=12 clauses_discharged=17/463\\n---\\n> section coverage: bindings=59 full=1 partial=4 sliver=1 unevidenced=49 unmeasured=4 unowned=12 clauses_discharged=26/489\\n2757c2786\\n< Fifty-six section bindings discharge 17 of the 463 normative clauses their\\n---\\n> Fifty-nine section bindings discharge 26 of the 489 normative clauses their\\n2762,2763c2791,2798\\n< refusal arm), three are\\n< `partial` (Section 14.2 at 8/9, bound to\\n---\\n> refusal arm), four are\\n> `partial` (Section 13.13 at 9/11, bound to\\n> [`internal/matjournal`](internal/matjournal) with the\\n> [`internal/crashgate`](internal/crashgate) conformance harness, whose\\n> undischarged clauses `13.13#4` and `13.13#5` are the rollback/parked\\n> visibility sentences through event, CLI/status, audit, and\\n> lifecycle-projection surfaces this repository has no binary or projection to\\n> produce; Section 14.2 at 8/9, bound to\\n2786c2821,2822\\n< implementation), three are `unmeasured` (Sections 7.3, 13.14.5 and 15.2, each of\\n---\\n> implementation), four are `unmeasured` (Sections 7.3, 13.12, 13.14.5 and\\n> 15.2, each of\\n2788c2824\\n< and forty-eight are `unevidenced`. Twelve sections are recorded unowned.\\n---\\n> and forty-nine are `unevidenced`. Twelve sections are recorded unowned.\\n2799c2835\\n< One admitted binding out of fifty-six covers a single clause, and it is\\n---\\n> One admitted binding out of fifty-nine covers a single clause, and it is\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3443,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 861,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
