p registry candidate delta\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"old cases: 105 new cases: 107\\nadded: ['crash-gate-journal-conformance', 'crash-gate-checkpoint-conformance']\\nremoved: []\\norder preserved for old: True\\nownership changed: True\\nNEW ownership entry keys: {\\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\\"materialization-journal-recovery\\\", \\\"crash-gate-journal-conformance\\\", \\\"crash-gate-checkpoint-conformance\\\"], \\\"clauses\\\": [{\\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\\"crash-gate-journal-conformance\\\", \\\"crash-gate-checkpoint-conformance\\\"], \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"Every implementation MUST inject a crash and a clean process restart at every\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"13.13#1\\\", \\\"line\\\": 9969}, {\\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\\"crash-gate-journal-conformance\\\"], \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"After restart, the recovery evaluator MUST classify the operation into exactly\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"13.13#2\\\", \\\"line\\\": 9971}, {\\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\\"crash-gate-journal-conformance\\\", \\\"c\\nNEW ownership entry keys: {\\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\\"materialization-journal-recovery\\\", \\\"crash-gate-journal-conformance\\\"], \\\"coverage\\\": \\\"unmeasured\\\", \\\"gap\\\": \\\"Recover classifies the journal-observable Section 13.12 failure rows (operator interrupt, owner-resume response lost, atomic rename blocked, disk full, task-board import/open/adopt failure before and after the new lease) into the Section 13.13 outcomes, proved by the crashgate conformance harness; the scanner finds no clause line in the table-shaped Section 13.12 so the binding stays unmeasured, and rows owned by sync, lease, provider, bridge, and lifecycle flows (SSH \\nOLD ownership entry keys: {\\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\\"materialization-journal-recovery\\\"], \\\"coverage\\\": \\\"unevidenced\\\", \\\"gap\\\": \\\"Recover classifies every crash boundary of Section 13.13 into exactly one outcome with durable parked and rollback evidence; provider, bridge, and replica states stay modeled and no clause of Section 13.13 is enumerated.\\\", \\\"keys\\\": [\\\"section:13.13\\\"], \\\"kind\\\": \\\"section_binding\\\", \\\"production\\\": {\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"Recover\\\", \\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/matjournal/recover.go\\\"}}\\nOLD ownership entry keys: {\\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\\"materialization-journal-recovery\\\"], \\\"coverage\\\": \\\"unmeasured\\\", \\\"gap\\\": \\\"Recover classifies the journal-observable Section 13.12 failure rows into the Section 13.13 outcomes; the scanner finds no clause line in the table-shaped Section 13.12, so the binding is unmeasured rather than unevidenced.\\\", \\\"keys\\\": [\\\"section:13.12\\\"], \\\"kind\\\": \\\"section_binding\\\", \\\"production\\\": {\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"Recover\\\", \\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/matjournal/recover.go\\\"}}\\nunowned equal: True\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2413,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 604,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
