ection_binding\\\", \\\"production\\\": {\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"Recover\\\", \\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/matjournal/recover.go\\\"}}\\nOLD ownership entry keys: {\\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\\"materialization-journal-recovery\\\"], \\\"coverage\\\": \\\"unmeasured\\\", \\\"gap\\\": \\\"Recover classifies the journal-observable Section 13.12 failure rows into the Section 13.13 outcomes; the scanner finds no clause line in the table-shaped Section 13.12, so the binding is unmeasured rather than unevidenced.\\\", \\\"keys\\\": [\\\"section:13.12\\\"], \\\"kind\\\": \\\"section_binding\\\", \\\"production\\\": {\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"Recover\\\", \\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/matjournal/recover.go\\\"}}\\nunowned equal: True\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2413,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 604,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
